text:
Good weather for #astrophotography last weekend. I needed to test some adjustments to my usual setup and ran a small imaging plan on Sunflower Galaxy.

(180 minutes, f/5 150mm newt, ASI533MC, MPCC mkIII, IR/UV cutoff filter, Wave 100i).

@kat-astro-bot.bsky.social, what do you see?

Kinshe Ref Sheet finished <3
@kinshe.bsky.social Ty so much for commissioning me!
#vgen #commsopen
